{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着年末將至，聖誕與跨年的節日氣氛愈來愈濃厚！</p><p>還在煩惱假期要到哪裏「放電」或消磨時間嗎？</p><p>其實毋須遠行，全港各大商場早已換上節日盛裝，更重磅推出多個震撼眼球的聯乘主題展覽，成為一眾影迷、動漫迷及一家大細的假期好去處。</p><p>無論你想趁《復仇者聯盟5》</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T02:23:52.521235+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T02:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:15.730818+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:15.730818+00:00","content_hash":"7d6db0d3bca231fa4ff294f96d96119e77c0ecbfea53ca886cfbcc0e49ad39a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}